{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415759","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415759","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041575901:0":{"text":"まさか、またお前に会うとはな。","source_cn":"没想到还能再见到你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A191BAD1F11F51C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041575902:0":{"text":"同感だ……","source_cn":"彼此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x354BE04259F64BC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041575903:0":{"text":"ヤクボルは今どうなっている？","source_cn":"雅库伯尔近来如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1608E65D6BF8599","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041575904:0":{"text":"もし本当に気になるなら、この地へ戻ってくればいいだけの話だ。","source_cn":"若你真心在意雅库伯尔，就该回归故土，守卫这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6A8211B17A0CAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041575905:0":{"text":"猟血祭の勝者で、神の力を持つ勇士……ヤクボルを護ることが、お前に課せられた使命ではないのか！？","source_cn":"你是猎血节的勇士，拥有神赐之力，护卫雅库伯尔本该是你的使命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x588723DB5530FB25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041575906:0":{"text":"……そのヤクボルは、あなたはのせいでどうなった？強き者は弱き者を迫害し、戦士になれないものはバルトシアへ追いやられ、一切れの肉さえ分けてもらえない。","source_cn":"看看雅库伯尔在你的统治下变成了什么样子吧。强者与弱者敌...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CC07A4BE117DA0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041575907:0":{"text":"ゴーダン様、かつてのあなたは立派な長だった……それがどうして、こんなことになってしまったんですか？","source_cn":"戈丹，你曾经是一位称职的首领……为什么会变成现在这样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D18E218F0D991F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041575908:1":{"text":"よくもそんな口を……神の加護さえ失わなければ、ヤクボルがこんな窮地に陥るはずがないだろ！","source_cn":"你还有胆子提……如果不是失去神佑，雅库伯尔怎么会面临困境？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC636800E1B0D2DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041575909:1":{"text":"尽きることのない、対等に渡り合える獲物……それらがなくなった今、ヤクボルはもう昔のようには生きられんのだ！","source_cn":"源源不绝的野兽、能够匹敌的猎物！有了这些，雅库伯尔才能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x620D811E55976271","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041575910:1":{"text":"狩猟神が求めたのは狩人と獲物の均衡だ。だからこそ、獲物があふれることも、狩人が滅びることもなかった。","source_cn":"狩猎神要猎手与猎物的平衡，既不会让猎物泛滥，也不会让猎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F318377F320C23A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041575911:1":{"text":"しかし神は堕ちた……森の獣はますます凶暴化し、多くの戦士が戦場で倒れた。","source_cn":"但她陨落了……丛林中的野兽愈发凶猛。在那么多战士折亡于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA31BE534CA5FC4EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041575912:1":{"text":"あのときの惨状は、お前もその目で見たはずだ。","source_cn":"那时的惨状你我亲眼目睹，谁也无法否认。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20A67E5E04DA148F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041575913:1":{"text":"狩りが困難なら、他の道を探せばいい……","source_cn":"既然狩猎艰难，那就减少狩猎，总有其他出路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE8BB024BBE5B41E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041575914:1":{"text":"バルトシアには大量の小麦がある。たとえ獲物がなくても、食料に困ることはないはずだ。","source_cn":"而且水泽营地还种植着大量小麦。就算没有猎物，雅库伯尔也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A62A7EE7947D2FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041575915:1":{"text":"あれは貧弱なホーリンどもの食い物だ。我ら戦士が口にするものではない！","source_cn":"那是懦弱的呼临人的食物，不是战士的食物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFA3635C5D5B9522","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041575916:1":{"text":"バルトシアの連中を