"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041575921:1":{"text":"「弱者」と呼ぶ者を追い出すのが、ヤクボルの本来の姿だというのか？","source_cn":"别再狡辩了。你将所谓的弱者赶出树怒山谷时，可没有留半分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x297BD9F72A3DEF45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041575922:1":{"text":"ならお前は、戦士が犠牲を払いながら狩ってきた獲物を、キャンプで安穏と暮らす奴らへ平等に分け与えろと？","source_cn":"那你也该知道，每次狩猎，每次出战，战士们死伤惨重。躲在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79019F398CD355DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041575923:1":{"text":"彼らが役立たずだとは言っていない。だが命を張って戦っている戦士に、より多くを与えて何が悪い！","source_cn":"我承认他们对雅库伯尔有用。可是冲锋陷阵、为雅库伯尔贡献...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0663E41934434CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1041575924:1":{"text":"我とて、戦士たちの心に生じた怒りを止めることはできん。","source_cn":"即便是我，也无法阻止战士们心生怨忿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x400BCD507AEAE44E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1041575925:1":{"text":"我がヤクボルに残されたわずかな戦士を見捨てれば、それこそヤクボルの未来は完全に潰えてしまう。","source_cn":"我不能枉顾雅库伯尔仅存的战士，让他们带着怨恨之心离去。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D193542D0D24DC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1041575926:1":{"text":"……それが冷酷だと言っているのだ。","source_cn":"……你太冷酷了，戈丹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30573C7EED1F223B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1041575927:0":{"text":"あなたの言う弱者も強者も、おれにとっては同じ仲間だ。どちらかを犠牲にするなど、できるはずがない。","source_cn":"你所谓的强者和弱者，在我看来都是平等的。无论如何也不该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A3F76863DBE7A1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1041575928:1":{"text":"ふん、お前も首領になれば分かる。","source_cn":"你不是首领，可以持中不言。但我不行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8C9B539FE770593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1041575929:1":{"text":"お前の目には、我が罪人のように映ってるのかもしれないが、ヤクボルはこの最も苦しい時期を乗り越えねばならんのだ。たとえ分裂したとしても、滅亡するよりマシだ！","source_cn":"或许我会因自己的选择而成为另一些人眼中的罪人，但雅库伯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BB4062E2B3D7565","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1041575930:1":{"text":"いずれ誰かが我に取って代わる。お前でもガーラでもいい、評価を下すのはそれからにしろ。","source_cn":"到时候，你也好，加拉也罢。谁来取代我，如何评判我，随便你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80E4B9D4B1275A5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1041575931:1":{"text":"……おれがあなたの考えに賛同することはない。","source_cn":"……我无法认同你的理念。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A4E277D17AAD931","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1041575932:1":{"text":"その理念がヤクボルの伝統を守る一助になるとしても……あなたを認めることは決してない。","source_cn":"也许你说的有一点道理，也许这的确能让雅库伯尔的传统得以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCA2A64C30DBB531","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1041575933:1":{"text":"だったらお前は去るのではなく、我に挑み新たな首領となって、お前の信じる道へヤクボルを導けばよかったのだ。","source_cn":"那么你就应该挑战我，击败我，成为新的首领，让雅库伯尔走...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F4C5F8F7357759A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1041575934:1":{"text":"我はそのような者が現れるのを待っていた。だが誰一人として、この重責を引き受けようとする者はいなかった！","source_cn":"我一直期待着有人来夺取这个首领之位，可惜没人愿意承担这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CD602C50E5B0793","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1041575935:1":{"text":"不満があるならなぜ挑んでこない？批判に晒され続けるのは、決して心地よいものではない。だが首領である我には、決断を下す義務がある！","source_cn":"既然你不满，为什么不来挑战我这个暴君？当一个备受争议的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11B6530D3B228C1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""